<title>JAPAN: Tomiya Apparel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tomiya Apparel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.77		vs	   13.54</p>
<p> Operating	  618    million	  vs	  467    million</p>
<p> Current	    600    million	  vs	  505    million</p>
<p> Net		  247    million	  vs	  198    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.61 yen	  vs	   11.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tomiya Apparel Co Ltd is a maker and wholesaler of men&quot;s shirts.</p>
</text>
